WEBVTT

00:53:58.663 --> 00:54:03.329
make money and so forth, they
also in the knowledge age.

00:54:04.288 --> 00:54:09.121
Can't make money if they have pissed
off too many of their employees

00:54:09.121 --> 00:54:13.621
and customers and investors by analogy
of the climate space right now,

00:54:13.996 --> 00:54:15.371
you can see more and more companies,

00:54:15.371 --> 00:54:19.454
even those that are emitting huge amounts
of carbon dioxide, saying, wait a sec,

00:54:19.454 --> 00:54:22.704
we're struggling to recruit talented
people because they don't want to work

00:54:22.704 --> 00:54:24.996
for someone who's evil. And their
customers are saying,

00:54:24.996 --> 00:54:27.121
we don't want to buy something
that is evil.

00:54:27.454 --> 00:54:33.121
And so, you know, ultimately you can
picture processes where they do better.